---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  description="Fryrvo Music Content License."
  title="Music License · Fryrvo"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="sm:pb:20 flex flex-col gap-4 pb-16 text-center">
      <img
        class="h-[150px] w-[250px] mx-auto rounded-3xl object-contain"
        src="https://cdn.fryrvo.com/assets/fryrvo_branding/Logo_bg.png"
        alt="icon"
      />

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Fryrvo Music License</h1>
      <p class="text-base">Date Issued: August 24, 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">You Have the Freedom To</h2>
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-4">
        <li>
          <strong>Share:</strong> Copy and redistribute my music in any medium or format.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Adapt:</strong> Remix, transform, and build upon my work (including covers, non commercial soundtracks, or any personal projects).
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mb-6 mt-12 text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">Conditions of Use</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Your use of my work is subject to these mandatory conditions:</p>
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-4">
        <li>
          <strong>Non Commercial Use Only:</strong> You may use my music for personal, non commercial projects only. If you wish to use my music for any commercial purpose including but not limited to monetized social media content, advertisements, games, or any business related project you must ask me first.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Attribution:</strong> You must provide proper credit to me.
          <br />
          <span class="text-sm italic">Example Credit: "Music by Fryrvo – [Link back to my Source]"</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mb-6 mt-12 text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">My Rights</h2>
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-4">
        <li>
          <strong>Take Down Policy:</strong> I reserve the right to request the immediate take-down or removal of my music from any platform if I believe it is being used in a manner that violates these terms, or at my sole discretion for any other reason.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Right to Modify:</strong> I reserve the right to change these terms at any time. Your continued use of my music following any changes constitutes your agreement to the updated terms.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mb-6 mt-12 text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">Additional Conditions</h2>
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-4">
        <li>
          The license does not cover ownership of the content; it provides usage rights as defined in our terms and conditions.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mb-6 mt-12 text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        If you have any questionsplease contact at Music@Fryrvo.com.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>